I am in the new room.
This room is very quiet.
I look here and there in the room.
There is a bed here.
And there is also a sturdy table.
The switch for the fan is on the wall.
I press the switch and turn on the fan.
There is a window in the room.
I am near the window.
Outside, it is night.
Mumbai is a very big city.
This city is completely new to me.
In the dark, the city stretches very far.
I am alone here.
Mexico is very far from here.
I suddenly miss Mexico very much.
For a moment, I am sad.
